          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Let\u2019s turn your sweet potatoes into something that feels like it came off a steakhouse menu \ud83d\udd25\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf60 Base (what you\u2019re starting with)\nRoasted, saut\u00e9ed, or baked sweet potatoes \u2192 already great  \nNow we layer *contrast* (sweet + salty + acid + texture)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd25 Pick Your \u201cFancy Direction\u201d\n\n### \ud83c\udf6f 1. Sweet + Salty Luxe\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"roasted sweet potatoes honey butter pecans\",\"sweet potatoes with goat cheese and honey drizzle\",\"candied pecans roasted sweet potatoes\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\nAdd:\n- **Hot honey** or maple syrup  \n- **Crumbled goat cheese** or feta  \n- **Candied pecans** or walnuts  \n\n\ud83d\udc49 This hits sweet, creamy, crunchy = addictive\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\uddc4 2. Savory Garlic Herb (restaurant vibe)\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"garlic herb roasted sweet potatoes rosemary thyme\",\"parmesan roasted sweet potatoes crispy edges\",\"butter garlic sweet potatoes skillet\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\nAdd:\n- **Garlic + butter**\n- **Fresh rosemary or thyme**\n- **Parmesan** at the end  \n\n\ud83d\udc49 Tastes like something you\u2019d get with a steak\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf36\ufe0f 3. Spicy Cajun Glow-Up\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"cajun sweet potatoes skillet spicy glaze\",\"sweet potatoes with chili lime seasoning\",\"spicy roasted sweet potatoes lime juice\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\nAdd:\n- **Cajun seasoning** + smoked paprika  \n- **Lime juice** (important)  \n- Drizzle of **honey** to balance heat  \n\n\ud83d\udc49 Sweet + heat + citrus = \ud83d\udd25\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udd53 4. Loaded Sweet Potato (crowd favorite)\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"loaded sweet potato bacon sour cream chives\",\"twice baked sweet potato loaded toppings\",\"sweet potato with bacon cheese chives\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\nAdd:\n- **Crispy bacon**\n- **Sour cream or Greek yogurt**\n- **Chives or green onions**\n- Little **cheddar cheese**\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Like a loaded baked potato but better\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd11 Chef Trick (this changes everything)\nRight before serving:\n- Add a tiny drizzle of **acid** (lemon or lime)  \n- Add a pinch of **flaky salt**\n\nThat contrast is what makes people go \u201cwait\u2026 why is this so good?\u201d\n\n---\n\nIf you tell me how you\u2019re cooking them (oven, air fryer, stove), I\u2019ll give you a *perfect step-by-step version* that hits every time."
          ]
